flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Apply table fonts, row height, grid, selection rules]
    B --> C[Read table header]
    C --> D{Header exists?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Apply header font]
    D -- No --> F[Continue]
    E --> F
    F --> G{showHeader is false?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Hide header]
    G -- No --> I[Keep header]
    H --> J[Create custom cell renderer]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Loop through columns]
    K --> L[Assign renderer to column]
    L --> M{More columns?}
    M -- Yes --> K
    M -- No --> N[End]
